{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>ויצאה</b> — two times in the Masorah. The other: ויצאה מביתו והלכה והיתה לאיש אחר. For אמה is juxtaposed to אשה: just as אשה is acquired by שטר, so too אמה is acquired by שטר." "<b>אין כסף</b> — in gematria: בסימנין. אין כסף is adjacent to מכה איש ומת, teaching that if he struck and died, he is not liable to pay money, for he is held liable under a greater charge."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:50.080192937Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}